{"version":1,"key":"card:397","content":{"id":397,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我们对系统的某个部分进行加速时，对系统整体的加速效果取决于该部分的占比以及加速程度。","highlight":"red"},{"type":"formatted","text":"假设该部分占比为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\alpha","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\alpha"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿，速度提升为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"k","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"k"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿，考虑原来的运行时间为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"T_{\\text{old}}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"T_{\\text{old}}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿，那么加速后的运行时间为"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"T_{\\text{new}} = (1 - \\alpha) T_{\\text{old}} + \\alpha \\frac{T_{\\text{old}}}{k} = (1 - \\alpha + \\alpha/k) T_{\\text{old}}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那么系统整体的加速比为"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"S = \\frac{T_{\\text{old}}}{T_{\\text{new}}} = \\frac{1}{1 - \\alpha + \\alpha / k}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个定律被称为 Amdahl 定律。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设该部件占比为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\alpha = 60\\%","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\alpha = 60\\%"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，速度提升为原来的 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"k = 2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"k = 2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 倍，那么系统的整体提升为"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"S = \\frac{1}{1 - 0.6 + 0.6 / 2} = 1.428","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"整体的加速比小于某部分的加速比，如下想显著提升系统整体的速度，那就需要改善系统绝大部分组件的速度。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"考虑一个极端的情况，假设对系统某个部件的速度改善到了极致，即 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"k \\rightarrow \\infty","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"k \\rightarrow \\inf"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿，系统此时整体的加速比为"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"S = \\frac{1}{1 - \\alpha}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设这部分的占比为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"60\\%","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"60%"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么系统的加速比为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":" S= 2.5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":" = 2.5"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿，即使我们对某一点进行了极致的优化，系统整体加速比的提升并没有想象的那么明显，要得到更好的加速比，我们必须优化系统中的大部分组件。"}],"disableDrag":false}],"tags":["Amdahl 定律"],"createTime":1704901957560,"updateTime":1763390364253,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1763390364253}}